# .gitignore

# ==========================================================================
# === SECTION 1: DEPENDENCIES & PACKAGE MANAGERS ===
# ==========================================================================
# WHY THIS FIX WAS MADE: Ignore all node_modules directories across all monorepo 
# packages and applications to prevent committing heavy third-party vendor code.
**/node_modules/
node_modules/

# Yarn Plug'n'Play and berry cache exclusions
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions
# === SECTION 1 END ===

# ==========================================================================
# === SECTION 2: ENVIRONMENT SECRETS & CRYPTOGRAPHIC KEYS ===
# ==========================================================================
# WHY THIS FIX WAS MADE: Use a comprehensive wildcard pattern (.env*) to block 
# ALL environment file variations (staging, production, vault, etc.) while 
# explicitly whitelisting template files (.env.example).
.env
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.template

# WHY THIS FIX WAS MADE: Broadened key extension matching to catch all common 
# private key formats, certificates, and SSH credentials before they leak.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.pfx
*.p12
id_rsa
id_ed25519

# WHY THIS FIX WAS MADE: Exclude local SQLite database files and database 
# dumps from git tracking to prevent leaking local PII or test records.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-journal
*.dump
*.sql
# === SECTION 2 END ===

# ==========================================================================
# === SECTION 3: BUILD OUTPUTS, COMPILERS & CACHES ===
# ==========================================================================
# Next.js build and static export artifacts
**/.next/
.next/
**/out/
**/build/
**/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# WHY THIS FIX WAS MADE: Prevent committing generated ORM client binaries, 
# native C++ nodes, or cross-platform compiled database engine artifacts.
**/generated/
*.so.node
*.dylib
*.dll.node
# === SECTION 3 END ===

# ==========================================================================
# === SECTION 4: LOGS, DIAGNOSTICS & RUNTIME DATA ===
# ==========================================================================
# Test coverage reports
**/coverage/

# WHY THIS FIX WAS MADE: Added catch-all wildcard (*.log) to ensure application 
# runtime logs and error traces are omitted alongside package manager logs.
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# Vercel & cloud deployment telemetry
.vercel
# === SECTION 4 END ===

# ==========================================================================
# === SECTION 5: IDE, OS & SYSTEM METADATA ===
# ==========================================================================
# WHY THIS FIX WAS MADE: Ignore IDE project settings (.vscode, .idea) to prevent 
# developer workspace conflicts and eliminate local pathing disclosures.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.sublime-workspace

# Operating system cache files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
# === SECTION 5 END ===
.aider*
